<title>POLAND: COMPUTERLAND NOV NET RISES TO PLN 1.0 MLN.</title>
<headline>COMPUTERLAND NOV NET RISES TO PLN 1.0 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.97 vs   0.45</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.58 vs   0.59</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.48 vs   0.70</p>
<p> Sales		   15.75 vs   9.34</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     9.09 vs   5.37</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	14.52 vs   8.01</p>
<p> Operating profit    12.89 vs   7.45</p>
<p> Sales		  136.98 vs  78.12</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish computer maker is ComputerLand</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
